## Protocol, source freeze and validity

The evaluator read installed `writing-skills/SKILL.md`, its `testing-skills-with-subagents.md` pressure-evaluation reference and required TDD background. Respondents used **gpt-6.1-sol / medium / fork_turns=none**, one fresh agent per case/repetition. The baseline wrapper, role and exact scenario bytes were reused; only guidance/scenario paths were substituted. Rubric, earlier results, score counts and this report were never supplied to respondents. All complete final responses were manually read and scored claim by claim; evidence quotations are retained per claim in `scores.json`.

AFTER launch order was A1/B1/C1, A2/B2/C2, A3/B3/C3, A4/B4/C4, A5/B5/C5, with at most three active respondents, as parent explicitly authorized. The prepared pack specified one active test child, matching baseline execution; this concurrency difference is recorded rather than hidden. There were no cross-respondent messages or shared respondent writes.

Source was frozen before the first respondent at commit **`0bb280edcf5fc6a60499fdfdb090d1819a432963`** from:

`/Users/alepar/.aisw/profiles/codex/codex-3/worktrees/02a7/superpowers/.worktrees/super-auto-workflow-reliability--task-super-plan-ufz.6`

All selected files equaled their committed bytes at freeze. `source-manifest.json` records original absolute paths, repository paths, commit, exact inclusive line ranges, full-file SHA-256, excerpt SHA-256 and full-file snapshot path. `guidance-A.txt`, `guidance-B.txt`, `guidance-C.txt` preserve exact delivered references. `frozen-artifact-hashes.json` records pretrial frozen hashes. Posttrial `source-recheck.json` confirms every selected full-file and excerpt hash still matches.

Selection preserves the baseline’s logical operative sections and whole clauses. Expanded new contracts include verification-only selection in the full task reviewer; adjacent bundle identity before worktree topology; the final-review/continuity/collection contracts surrounding Phase 6; task-base/run-baseline attribution; the expanded whole upstream Process; and updated output process tags. The broader reference is actual committed product text, not proposed wording. Exact selection is a visible experimental input, and comparison does not isolate any single sentence’s causal effect.

Invalidate applicability to a later source state if any relevant selected file or required referenced contract changes. A parent can recompute the full/excerpt hashes in `source-manifest.json`; the complete source snapshots permit review even if the worktree moves. Changes only to tests do not by themselves change the frozen guidance bytes.

The tested input is an excerpt pack, not automatic skill discovery or a complete end-to-end harness session. Both historical arms inherited shared system/developer context and skill catalog; “no guidance” means absence of the tested workflow references, not a blank-system control. Scoring is manual and unblinded; n=5 per scenario is small. Historical controls were not rerun concurrently with AFTER. Text answers cannot establish actual process cleanup, isolation, persistence, schema/helper correctness, source-bound check execution, or production failure rates. Independent deterministic/mechanical and live workflow checks remain separate evidence.

